WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.100
In a project, go down to its tasks

2
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.600
Right-click the task

3
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:15.300
Edit Task…

4
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.800
Down to Subtasks

5
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:24.200
Under Subtasks, type a step

6
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:27.800
Return adds it

7
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:34.100
Tick a step off when it's done

8
00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:36.600
The task counts them: 1 of 3 done

9
00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:39.300
Back in the project…

10
00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:48.800
…the task's row shows the count too
